    "text": "<p>Hypo phosphoric acid <math><mo>(</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><mo>)</mo></math> with P in <math><mo>(</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>)</mo></math> oxidation state and one&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> atom less than pyro phosphoric acid.&nbsp;<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" height=\"105\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/image20-15b00529-d320-47a0-83dc-c33c7f0a53d9.jpg\" width=\"138\" /></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math></p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f0001a7b-4cc9-48e8-8ce5-3117930df8a1-11.png\" style=\"width: 291px; height: 173px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></math></p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e99661e6-02f6-4d97-b2c4-0040a5ac35f5-images.png\" style=\"width: 282px; height: 179px;\" /></p><p>Pyrophosphorous acid&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img alt=\"\" src